    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but you don't get it, it's not just a symptom. everything is just constant. it's like looking at a door that's been closed for years and finally realizing you can just walk out of it. like, why is everyone so obsessed with holding onto something that's clearly just hurting me? wouldn't it be more compassionate to just let someone go if they're in this much pain?",
