      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a profound exhaustion with chronic pain and the fight to keep going. Wanting release when the suffering is constant is a deeply human response to relentless pain. While the impulse to let go when things hurt so much is understandable, please remember that compassion can also mean finding paths to *less* pain. Reaching out to a crisis line or a therapist can help you explore paths to alleviate this constant heaviness safely.",
